# Keep the build context small and secret-free: the image is built from source and the lockfile only.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.vite
.git
.github
.claude
docs
*.md

# Secrets never enter an image. Configuration is passed at run time (env_file in compose).
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
